Author: Dante Loi <danteloi1993@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Jul 22 19:09:03 2026 +0200

    expert-offload: GGUF populate for the offload expert cache (pread + mlock)
    
    Fills the offload cache (separate from SSD-streaming) from the GGUF at startup:
    for each owned routed expert, pread gate/up/down into a fresh mlock'd slab slot
    laid out gate|up|down contiguous — the same layout the streaming slabs use, so
    the upcoming offload compute can bind these slots to the existing slots6 Metal
    kernels (no new GPU code). Reuses the proven ds4_gpu_stream_expert_pread_into.
    
