      a budget-bounded slab allocator that mlocks each slab (best effort; mlock
      failure warns and continues). Resolves the prior commit's expected-unused
      warnings.
    - ds4.c: ds4_engine_offload_populate_cache — sizes experts via the existing
      streaming_layer_gate_down_expert_bytes, installs up to a budget in (layer,
      expert) order.
    - ds4_cli.c: worker invokes populate gated by DS4_OFFLOAD_CACHE_EXPERTS
      (0/unset = disabled -> unchanged direct-mmap compute). OOM-safety knob
      mirroring --ssd-streaming-cache-experts; populate failure is non-fatal.
    - ds4_gpu.h / ds4.h: public declarations.
    
    Builds clean (all targets, zero warnings). Phase-0 RTT gate still PASS.
