    expert-offload: add the offload expert cache data structure (separate from SSD-streaming)
    
    A separate LRU expert cache for the offload feature (plan: coordinator holds hot
    ~64%, worker holds cold ~36%, union = 100%), distinct from g_stream_expert_cache_*.
    Per-layer/per-expert entry table + mlock'd Metal slab slots, to be populated from
    the GGUF (pread) at startup and read by an offload compute path that reuses the
    existing slots6 Metal kernels (no new GPU code).
    
